WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.480
DeepL is a machine translation
API for the text and documents

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.188
you send it.

3
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.844
General Translation adds context,

4
00:00:07.844 --> 00:00:09.760
review, consistent terms,

5
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.408
and continuous translation.

6
00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:16.563
With DeepL, your code writes a
context string and passes glossary

7
00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:18.245
IDs on each request.

8
00:00:18.645 --> 00:00:22.151
General Translation takes context
from your code and applies

9
00:00:22.151 --> 00:00:24.298
one Glossary to every project.

10
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:28.295
Reviewers edit each translation
next to its source in the Dashboard.

11
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:34.455
Then npx gt translate in CI
translates only content whose source

12
00:00:34.455 --> 00:00:35.104
changed.

13
00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:38.087
Your team now ships
Polish with each release.
